#playroom object.aai

#Item Flags
# ITEMFLAG_MAP			0001	(1)
# ITEMFLAG_AIRCOLLIDE	00xx	(2)
# ITEMFLAG_VISBLOCK		0100	(256)
# Altitute (EXTRA line) - distance above ground (floating). If object has any alt, then height affects copter shadow.
# Height then becomes distance between alt (bottom) and top of object. Floaters cannot blk grd movemt
# State - like damage state
# Lnks - if you have several objects that always go together and you only want to put one in MapEdit, you can just 
# place them together with set offset using a new line
# Armor - reduces any hit by that amount of HP
# Item flags: 1 (placed in map? need it); 256 (opaque); 257 (both); Defaults to all flags; see Architect doc
# Hght - ht to collide with shots; affects if units can shoot over it? Changes elevation for region. Set to 0 unless
#	object does not extend to top of image area at hotspot's x-coord.
# Draw order - hi=top; units def to 1000
# vis - ?
# permeab - chance in 255 that a rifle-type projectile (no miss, bazoo) will pass through this object
# crush - causes this damage to units in damage mask when placed or changes
# states

#Obj Type		SubT	Ste	Lnk Fl			HP	Hgt	Mv	Ord		Slp			Arm	Vis 	Crush	Perm	Explosn		Sd

